{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>根據歐盟委員會聲明，Temu的整改計劃包含五項補救措施，旨在糾正相關違規問題。Temu需在四個月內開展中期風險評估，審查平台內容審核系統可能存在的缺陷，並採取相應措施。</p>\n<p>Temu發言人表示，公司歡迎歐盟委員會批准該計劃。Temu隸屬於拼多多控股（PDD Holdings）。</p>\n<p>此外，自今年7月初起，Temu、Shein等電商平台還受到歐盟針對低價值電商包裹徵收3歐元費用的影響。此前，價值低於150歐元的包裹進入歐盟可享受關税豁免。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1027/0df8d5c23ad1ebd.webp\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:02:01.644739+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T12:46:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T09:58:20.111023+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:58:38.278859+00:00","content_hash":"bedb7f5d0b583b778cd668b95105c25baec6940e74df9ef22fc6d6febfc13399","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T13:02:01.644739+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}